  "description": "Dear Anywhere bike,\n\nIt's hard to say goodbye to you, after all the amazing adventures we've had together. From riding through the city streets to exploring rugged terrain, you've been a trusty companion on every journey.\n\nOne of the things that made our rides so enjoyable is the Smoothie handlebar we designed for you.\n\nWe wanted to make sure that our first rigid fork bike also had a good ride, so we designed this stealth, yet effective, S-glass fiber and carbon fiber suspension-handlebar. It was a bold move. But the physics behind it made so much sense, so we decided to challenge convention and go for it! As we do.\n\nRiders immediately loved it, and they quickly demanded it made its way onto our True Grit gravel bikes as well.\n\nThe Smoothie is a true testament to our commitment to innovation and creativity in design.\n\nAs we bid farewell to you, Anywhere, we'll always cherish the memories we've made together. You'll be missed, but your legacy will live on through the many riders who have experienced the joy of riding with you.\n\nSincerely,\n\nThe Lauf Team",
